# =============================================================================
#  ECE544 final project - keep only what is needed to rebuild the system.
#
#  Kept:
#    hdl/, constraints/, sw/            RTL, pin constraints, drivers + apps
#    final_project.xpr                  Vivado project (references hdl/ in place)
#    final_project.srcs/                block design (.bd/.bda/ui) + IP .xci files
#    mbc_wb_nexys4DDR.xsa               exported hardware (bitstream included)
#    sim/ sources                       testbenches and run scripts
#    PlatformIO/ESP32_bridge            ESP32 project (has its own .gitignore)
# =============================================================================

# ---- Vivado: generated output (all rebuilt from .xpr + .srcs + hdl) ---------
